.TH gitaway-profile-remove 1  "gitaway 0.0.0" "gitaway manual"
.SH NAME
gitaway\-profile\-remove \- Delete a profile
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgitaway profile remove\fR [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete a profile
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Don\*(Aqt ask for confirmation
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
The profile to delete
